      "content": "hey so i got this really sharp pain in my lower right stomach area and i feel kinda nauseous. i think i just havent gone to the bathroom in a few days so maybe i'm just backed up? should i take some strong laxatives to get things moving or maybe an antacid if it's gas? or should i just wait?",
